algorithms.pseudocode:
ALGORITHM ComputeDecoderCells(G, X):
  Input: Family G of profiles, ambient set X
  Output: Map from profiles to cells
  for each f in G:
    cell[f] = {}
    for each x in X:
      if f(x) <= g(x) for all g in G:
        cell[f] = cell[f] ∪ {x}
  return cell

Complexity: O(|G|² · |X|)
